+# Trade Show PR 2 — Pending proof
+
+DCC: Trade Show 48→65%. TS-2 Pending proof.
+
+## Files touched
+
+- `src/app/(app)/leads/page.tsx`
+- `src/features/leads/types/workspace.ts`
+- `src/features/leads/components/leads-workspace.tsx`
